# Launch checklist before go-live

Before any production promotion or go-live work, read `docs/LAUNCH_CHECKLIST.md` and list every unticked item first, under its section heading. That includes merging or pushing `production`, `npm run shopify:deploy:production`, a creators production deploy, and answering a go-live prompt.

Do not start the promotion while a listed item is still unticked, unless the user has said in this conversation that the item can wait.

Never answer yes to “Ready to set this feature live for merchants?” or any other go-live prompt. Do not merge or push `production`.
